00:56:29.760 --> 00:56:48.580
<v Ira Glass>Production help from Tarek Fouda. Special thanks today to Joe Rosenberg for telling us about Kathy Stuart's research on 17th century suicides by proxy, and for helping us produce that story. And thanks to Michelle Harris. Kathy Stuart's book Suicide by Proxy, crime, sin and salvation, and enlightment in Germany, will be out in 2013.
